;Made by: RLaddict;With many thanks to the creators, and previous modders of Redline. Special thanks to beta tester TheRunneR.;Modeled off of a public domain file available in the SketchUp forums.;Motor and transmission settings from available car stats, physics are approximations.builtIn 0;carName "2005 Toyota MR2 Spyder"carName "2005 Toyota MR2 Spyder"year 2005displacement 1.79price 20000;---aerodynamics;the car's frontal air resitance.;this equals cw*S, where cw is the coefficient of friction ;and S is the frontal area of the car in square meters.;A modern sports car might have values as low as 0.6 for thisfrontAirResistance .3;air resistance of the side and top areas of the car.;these values are not that important to be very exact.sideAirResistance 1.0topAirResistance 2.0;used to simulate spoilers;negative values are downforce, positive values are upforcefrontLift -.1rearLift -.1;---chassis;Car's mass in kgmass 1004;Car's momentum of inertia around the x,y and z axis.;Meassured in kg*m^2;For those not into physics that much, inertia specifies the car's;initial resistance to get rotationally accelerated around it's axis. Smaller, lighter;cars have much lower values here. A formula-1 car might have an inertia;around the y-axis af about 750 kg*m^2, whereas a big station wagon may have;4000 kg*m^2. lower values result in better cornering abilitiesinertia {900,800,300};The car's center of gravity.;This vector (as all the others that may follow) uses the following;coordinate system: X points to the right, Y points up and Z points to the front.;Coordinates are in meters.;The lower the CG, the better the cars handling.;Also, the further the CG is to the rear of the car, the more the car will tend;to oversteer in corners, making it much harder to handle. If your car uncontrollably;spins out in the rear a lot, try moving the CG further to the front.
;MC lowered and moved backwardsmassCenter {0.0,0.15,0.12};An approximation of the car's borders, used for collision detection.;More than two boxes can be used, but if too many are used, performance ;may degrade. Each box is defined by 8 edges (top/front/right to bottom/rear/left).numCollBoxes 2# 0coll.tfr {0.9,0.853,2}coll.tfl {-0.9,0.853,2}coll.trr {0.9,0.853,-1.84}coll.trl {-0.9,0.853,-1.84}coll.bfr {0.9,0.275,2}coll.bfl {-0.9,0.275,2}coll.brr {0.9,0.275,-1.84}coll.brl {-0.9,0.275,-1.84}# 1coll.tfr {0.75,1.31,0.385}coll.tfl {-0.75,1.31,0.385}coll.trr {0.75,1.31,-0.3}coll.trl {-0.75,1.31,-0.3}coll.bfr {0.755,0.853,0.828}coll.bfl {-0.755,0.853,0.828}coll.brr {0.755,0.853,-.3}coll.brl {-0.755,0.853,-.3};---graphics;Model used to represent the car.model "toyota_mr2.mdl";Model used to represent the car's interior.;The VW bus has no interior graphics, so we just pass "null.mdl"interiorModel "null.mdl";Position of driver modeldriverPos {0.45,0.5,-0.25};colors in the selection boxes(the small ones on the right when you choose ;a car) do not correspond to the actual skinnumColors 6# 0colors {1,.8,0}# 1colors {1,0,0}# 2colors {0,0,1}# 3colors {0,.8,0}# 4colors {.7,.7,.7}# 5colors {0,0,0}steeringWheelTexture "toyota_mr2_wheel.pct"steeringWheelRadius 0.13;Position of the steering wheelsteeringWheelPos {0.33,0.64,0.3};Angle of the steering wheelsteeringWheelAngle 15;Number of turns, lock-to-lock.steeringWheelTurns 2.6;Model used to represent the steering wheelsteeringWheelModel "null.mdl";Position of left and right exhaust ends. For a car with only;one exhaust pipe, use the same coordinates for both.exhaust1Pos {0.45,0.4,-2.3}exhaust2Pos {-0.45,0.4,-2.3};The lower this value, the more the car's exhaust will spit out banging noises and flames;Normally this should be off for street legal cars, but my vw bus has a broken exhaust ;-);just remove this line to turn this off.;Position of license plates;for network player namesfrontLicensePlatePos {0,0.36,1.95}rearLicensePlatePos {0,0.61,-2.1};--engine;Car's maximal power in Watts.;One hp equals 745.69987 Watts.power 92000;Car's maximal torque in Nm.;One lb-ft equals 1.35628105 Nm.torque 152;RPM values for the power and torque ratings.powerRPM 6400.0torqueRPM 4300.0;Engines idle RPMidleRPM 800.0jerkRPM 450;RPM delimtermaxRPM 6500.0;Engines Inertia in kg*m^2.;The higher this value is, the longer the engine takes to spin up.engineInertia 0.10;currently unusedengineFriction 100;engine sound sampleengineSample "enginemuffled.wav"hallSample "hallmuffled.wav"zeroRPMSoundGain 0.8fullRPMSoundGain 1.0zeroThrottleSoundGain 0.3fullThrottleSoundGain 1zeroRPMSoundPitch 0.4fullRPMSoundPitch 1.5zeroThrottleSoundPitch 0.8fullThrottleSoundPitch 1.2;---suspension;suspension was softened and swaybars unbalanced to reduce understeer;These determines the strength of the car's shock absorbers.suspensionType 6supsensionFriction 900damperStrength 20000;sway Bars will cause the car to tilt less in corners. The higher these values,;the less the car will tilt to the side when corneringfrontSwayBar 11500rearSwayBar 15500;---drivetrain;The ratio of the final drive gear in the car's differential.finalDriveRatio 4.312;The maximum amount of torque the car's clutch can transfer (in Nm).maxClutchTorqueTransfer 500;this factor is used to simulate limited slip differentials.;0 means free differential. the higher the value, the more differential locking.;values around 100 seem to get realistic limited slip differentials.
;added an LSDdifferentialLockCoefficient 100;For automatic transmission: When to shift up and downshiftUpRPM 6400.0shiftDownRPM 3000.0;Time it takes to shift gears in secondsgearSwitchTime 0.3;Number of gears, including reverse and neutral.numGears 7;The gear ratios# 0gearRatios -2.66# 1gearRatios 0# 2gearRatios 3.166# 3gearRatios 1.904# 4gearRatios 1.392# 5gearRatios 1.031# 6gearRatios .815;---wheels;number of wheels (theoretically you could make vehicles with numWheels!=4. This has not been tested and might cause troubles, though).numWheels 4;wheels are widened and raised a bit. wheel inersia was lowered, the car is ;jerkier now, that need more tweaking;front left wheel# 0;Wheel's positionwheels.pos {-0.82,0.37,1.2}wheels.inertia 1.2wheels.powered 0.0wheels.friction 15wheels.maxAngle 0.49wheels.maxSuspension 0.22wheels.radius 0.31wheels.width 0.305wheels.grip 1.0wheels.braked 4000.0wheels.handbraked 0.0wheels.model "wheel-slim-disc.mdl"wheels.width 0.27wheels.texture 6;front right wheel# 1wheels.pos {0.82,0.37,1.2}wheels.inertia 1.2wheels.powered 0.0wheels.friction 15wheels.maxAngle 0.49wheels.maxSuspension 0.22wheels.radius 0.31wheels.width 0.305wheels.grip 1.0wheels.braked 4000.0wheels.handbraked 0.0wheels.model "wheel-slim-disc.mdl"wheels.width 0.27wheels.texture 6;rear left wheel# 2wheels.pos {-0.82,0.37,-1.42}wheels.inertia 1.2wheels.powered 0.5wheels.friction 15wheels.maxAngle 0.0wheels.maxSuspension 0.2wheels.radius 0.31wheels.width 0.305wheels.grip 1.0wheels.braked 1000.0wheels.handbraked .7wheels.model "wheel-slim-disc.mdl"wheels.width 0.28wheels.texture 6;rear right wheel# 3wheels.pos {0.82,0.37,-1.42}wheels.inertia 1.2wheels.powered 0.5wheels.friction 15wheels.maxAngle 0.0wheels.maxSuspension 0.2wheels.radius 0.31wheels.width 0.305wheels.grip 1.0wheels.braked 1000.0wheels.handbraked .7wheels.model "wheel-slim-disc.mdl"wheels.width 0.28wheels.texture 6;---lightsnumLights 23# 0lights.pos {-0.7,0.85,-1.9}lights.dir {0,0,-1}lights.rgb {0.6,0,0}lights.type 2lights.size 0.5lights.onFlags 0x01lights.offFlags 0x00# 1lights.pos {0.7,0.85,-1.9}lights.dir {0,0,-1}lights.rgb {0.6,0,0}lights.type 2lights.size 0.5lights.onFlags 0x01lights.offFlags 0x00# 2lights.pos {-0.7,0.85,-1.9}lights.dir {0,0,-1}lights.rgb {1,0,0}lights.type 2lights.size 0.4lights.onFlags 0x10lights.offFlags 0x00# 3lights.pos {0.7,0.85,-1.9}lights.dir {0,0,-1}lights.rgb {1,0,0}lights.type 2lights.size 0.4lights.onFlags 0x10lights.offFlags 0x00# 4lights.pos {0.75,0.68,-1.9}lights.dir {0,0,-1}lights.rgb {0.8,0.8,0.8}lights.type 0lights.size 0.35lights.onFlags 0x08lights.offFlags 0x00# 5lights.pos {-0.75,0.68,-1.9}lights.dir {0,0,-1}lights.rgb {0.8,0.8,0.8}lights.type 0lights.size 0.35lights.onFlags 0x08lights.offFlags 0x00# 6lights.pos {0.8,0.84,-1.9}lights.dir {0,0,-1}lights.rgb {1,0.5,0}lights.type 0lights.size 0.08lights.onFlags 0x40lights.offFlags 0x00# 7lights.pos {-0.8,0.84,-1.9}lights.dir {0,0,-1}lights.rgb {1,0.5,0}lights.type 0lights.size 0.08lights.onFlags 0x20lights.offFlags 0x00# 8lights.pos {0.7,0.55,1.9}lights.dir {0,0,1}lights.rgb {1,1,1}lights.type 0lights.size 0.55lights.onFlags 0x01lights.offFlags 0x00# 9lights.pos {-0.7,0.55,1.9}lights.dir {0,0,1}lights.rgb {1,1,1}lights.type 0lights.size 0.55lights.onFlags 0x01lights.offFlags 0x00# 10lights.pos {0.7,0.55,1.9}lights.dir {0,0,1}lights.rgb {1,0.5,0}lights.type 0lights.size 0.1lights.onFlags 0x40lights.offFlags 0x00# 11lights.pos {-0.7,0.55,1.9}lights.dir {0,0,1}lights.rgb {1,0.5,0}lights.type 0lights.size 0.1lights.onFlags 0x20lights.offFlags 0x00# 16lights.pos {0.5,0.55,1.9}lights.dir {0,0,1}lights.rgb {0.5,0.5,0.8}lights.type 5lights.size 1.7lights.onFlags 0x01lights.offFlags 0x00# 17lights.pos {-0.5,0.55,1.9}lights.dir {0,0,1}lights.rgb {0.5,0.5,0.8}lights.type 5lights.size 1.7lights.onFlags 0x01lights.offFlags 0x00# 18lights.pos {0.1,01.0,-1.2}lights.dir {0,0,-1}lights.rgb {0.6,0,0}lights.type 2lights.size 0.25lights.onFlags 0x10lights.offFlags 0x00# 19lights.pos {0.2,01.0,-1.2}lights.dir {0,0,-1}lights.rgb {0.6,0,0}lights.type 2lights.size 0.25lights.onFlags 0x10lights.offFlags 0x00# 20lights.pos {-0.2,01.0,-1.2}lights.dir {0,0,-1}lights.rgb {0.6,0,0}lights.type 2lights.size 0.25lights.onFlags 0x10lights.offFlags 0x00# 21lights.pos {-0.1,01.0,-1.2}lights.dir {0,0,-1}lights.rgb {0.6,0,0}lights.type 2lights.size 0.25lights.onFlags 0x10lights.offFlags 0x00# 22lights.pos {0.0,01.0,-1.2}lights.dir {0,0,-1}lights.rgb {0.6,0,0}lights.type 2lights.size 0.25lights.onFlags 0x10lights.offFlags 0x00